---
title: "Contact - The Zero Fog"
permalink: /contact/
canonical: "https://thezerofog.com/contact/"
---
{% extends "layouts/base.njk" %}

{% block head_extras %}
<meta name="description" content="How to reach The Zero Fog team - support, refunds, privacy and copyright contacts.">
{% endblock %}

{% block page_css %}
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/css/pages/legal.css">
{% endblock %}

{% block content %}

<a href="/" class="brand">The Zero Fog</a>
<button class="theme-toggle" id="themeToggle" onclick="toggleTheme()">Light</button>

<article class="legal-page">

  <h1>Contact</h1>

  <div class="legal-meta">
    <p><strong>The Zero Fog</strong> &middot; thezerofog.com</p>
  </div>

  <p>The fastest way to reach us is email. Every message goes to a real person on the team, and we aim to respond within 2 business days.</p>

  {% if site.legal.address.isSet %}
  <h2>Postal address</h2>
  <p>
    {{ site.legal.address.line1 }}<br>
    {% if site.legal.address.line2 %}{{ site.legal.address.line2 }}<br>{% endif %}
    {{ site.legal.address.postalCode }} {{ site.legal.address.city }}<br>
    {{ site.legal.address.country }}
  </p>
  {% endif %}

  <h2>Support</h2>
  <p>Questions about the course, your order, account access, or anything technical:</p>
  <p><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:{{ site.email.support }}">{{ site.email.support }}</a></p>

  <h2>Refunds</h2>
  <p>To request a refund or ask about eligibility, see our <a href="/refunds/">Refund Policy</a> for the steps and timelines, then write to:</p>
  <p><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:{{ site.email.refunds }}">{{ site.email.refunds }}</a></p>

  <h2>Privacy &amp; data requests</h2>
  <p>To exercise your privacy rights - including access, correction, or deletion of your personal data - see our <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a> or write directly to:</p>
  <p><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:{{ site.email.privacy }}">{{ site.email.privacy }}</a></p>

  <h2>Copyright</h2>
  <p>For copyright notices and takedown requests:</p>
  <p><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:{{ site.email.copyright }}">{{ site.email.copyright }}</a></p>

</article>

{% endblock %}
